{"id":"2695165f0444a6d1","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"Arithmetical Diagonal Lemma","display":"df-diagonal-lemma — Arithmetical Diagonal Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["89-df-diagonal-lemma"],"display":"df-diagonal-lemma — Arithmetical Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-diagonal-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-lemma — Arithmetical Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\theta(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\">\\(\\vec z\\)</span> 无重复。</li>\n<li>编码、数词和避免捕获的同时替换取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}\\)</span> 是自由变元的有序全称闭合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\mathrm{ucl}(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\bigl(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\mathrm{ucl}(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\bigl(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留上游“对角引理”调用角色与本地 df 文件名；元数据类型记作 lemma。带参数式仍代入整个开放公式的固定语法码，不是把自由参数的数值实例码混入普通对角化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"编码、数词和避免捕获的同时替换取 [[89-df-godel-numbering]]、[[89-df-numeral]]；$\\mathrm{ucl}$ 是自由变元的有序全称闭合。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"编码、数词和避免捕获的同时替换取 [[89-df-godel-numbering]]、[[89-df-numeral]]；$\\mathrm{ucl}$ 是自由变元的有序全称闭合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec z)\\land\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\mathrm{ucl}(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}&\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\bigl(\\delta\\leftrightarrow\\theta[x:=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1605,"backlinks":[{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 53–55；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是带参数的同时对角化，复用单句对角引理的编码机制；单句无参数的 [[89-df-diagonal-lemma]] 不能直接当作同一签名使用。原书通过表示代入与对角函数给出构造；证明在这些编码函数上进行有限的同时自代入。若输入均为 $\\Sigma_1$（或 $\\Pi_1$），可取相同复杂度的 $S_i$。本条引用原书证明，编码函数的逐条 PA 表示证明未在此重新展开。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["7f53d84c2164d9c5","2e7227755a8473e0","86ad48bbd1843ed6","76cab88fafa3b379","d088b00b91690ba0"]}